<title>UK: Copper stable above lows on LME, spreads busy.</title>
<headline>Copper stable above lows on LME, spreads busy.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Market holding $2,375/80 support, but attention on spreads, which remaining tight for July. Output halt at Portugal's Neves Corvo not impacting, given current stock increases and expectations these will continue in medium-term.</p>
</text>
